<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-TALIBOR/TALIBID INTERBANK RATES CHANGE SLIGHTLY.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-TALIBOR/TALIBID INTERBANK RATES CHANGE SLIGHTLY.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average interbank one week</p>
<p>rates eased slightly from last week, the central bank said on</p>
<p>Wenesday.</p>
<p>One-month and three-month rates remained stable with the one</p>
<p>week rate falling by 0.03 percentage points.</p>
<p>&quot;The rates eased as it is the end of the month and all</p>
<p>banks have met the central bank's reserve requirements,&quot; Egi</p>
<p>Metsandi, a trader with Hansapank's money market department,</p>
<p>told Reuters.</p>
<p>Interest rates have also fallen on the overnight market.</p>
<p>&quot;The overnight rates are down to 2.8-2.5 percent from above</p>
<p>3.0 percent from last week,&quot; she added.</p>
<p>    TALIBOR/TALIBID   1Week	1Month    3Month</p>
<p>  July 30	    4.25/3.25    5.52/4.52  7.00/6.00</p>
<p>  July 23	    4.28/3.28    5.52/4.52  7.00/6.00</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
